'''Jal-MejRah''', commonly referred to as '''bats''', is a [[volcanic creature]] that is encountered in the [[Inferno]]. It is apparently the ancestor of the [[Tz-Kih]].

Jal-MejRahs function similar to a Tz-Kih, except rather than draining [[prayer points]] with their attack, they drain the player's [[run energy]] instead. They drain 3 run energy per hit. This '''can''' be prevented via [[Protect from Missiles]].

Jal-MejRah also has the ability to slightly drain a player's combat [[stats]], boosting its own by the same amount. This '''can''' be negated by praying [[Protect from Missiles]].

Jal-MejRah have a very short [[attack range]] compared to other Inferno creatures, at only 4 squares.

